Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.47,0:00:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新銀河接近
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是屬于處女座里的星球之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:46.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有智慧的生命體嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.44,0:00:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的話他的智慧程度是?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.17,0:00:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么畫像尋找開始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.94,0:00:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河周圍發現\N高速行進中的不明物體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫像擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫像擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.45,0:00:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.88,0:01:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒見過這樣的宇宙船呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是落伍的交通工具吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.49,0:01:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像還不夠文明
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 下一個獵物就是那個銀河
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.43,0:01:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先先登陸不起眼的無人星\N看看狀況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:15.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么進入超時空飛行
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.84,0:01:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！知道神秘列車嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地有可能是九州、四國\N或北海道很神秘的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那兒有各種有趣的活動\N在等著你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.82,0:01:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想參加的人實在太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.02,0:01:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車票雖然很難買
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.36,0:01:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我有3張
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！另外兩個讓誰去好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.30,0:01:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想大雄一定也很想去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，別管大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.81,0:01:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔！你看說曹操曹操就到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.71,0:01:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 各位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起\N神秘列車的車票已沒有了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有看到小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.45,0:02:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經三天沒回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.22,0:02:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他從來不會不打聲招呼\N就出門的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會被車撞到了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.13,0:02:17.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是被壞人帶走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們別這么不負責任的亂說
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的好擔心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萬一如果他發生了什么事的話
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎么辦才好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.94,0:02:31.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當不可能發生什么事情的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.98,0:02:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.98,0:02:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們家的狗“利娜”\N也是一星期后跑回來的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能掉到哪兒去了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，可以貼懸賞海報呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問保健所可能比較快唷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.12,0:02:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不是貓
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.26,0:02:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當劇場版 大雄和銀河超特急
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情真好\Nこんなこといいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以完成更好\Nできたらいいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.85,0:03:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那樣的　有這樣的\Nあんなゆめ　こんなゆめ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.00,0:03:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各式各樣的夢想\Nいっぱいあるけど
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家　大家　大家啊\Nみんな　みんな　みんな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.75,0:03:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫我實現愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.75,0:03:25.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那個神奇的口袋\Nふしぎなポッケで
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.75,0:03:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來幫我實現愿望啊\Nかなえてくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由自在的在天空飛翔\Nそらをじゆうに　とびたいな
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.35,0:03:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“來！給你竹蜻蜓！”\N“ハイ！タケコプター”
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜歡小叮當了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊　啊　啊\Nアン　アン　アン
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜歡小叮當了\Nとってもだいすきドラえもん
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里了啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當在找你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:24.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄先把晚飯吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.39,0:04:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么晚了你去哪兒啦?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是我要問你的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.76,0:04:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很擔心你嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.00,0:04:39.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了一下22世紀
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:43.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了一樣好東西喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?是什么好東西?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是現在最有人氣的22世紀\N銀河超特急的車票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,22世紀銀河超特急的車票?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.92,0:04:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！排了3天才拿到手的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.02,0:04:59.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 明天晚上出發的車票
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.29,0:05:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車是銀河超特急的神秘列車
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從銀河的中心出發
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知道目的地是哪里喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這樣才會有期待感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很想邀請你們去的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是好像行程有點重復的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太空旅行好像很好玩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.88,0:05:28.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊啊\N早知道就不要做無聊的約定了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.49,0:05:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎樣呢 一點也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙是很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又黑又暗也沒有空氣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好會被宇宙人抓去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.86,0:05:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定也會被流星撞到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與其這樣在地面上走\N還是絕對安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.24,0:05:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也這么認為
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到目前為止還沒有聽說過
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀河超特急有發生過任何事情
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:02.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說到宇宙船也只不過像\N游覽船一樣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.69,0:06:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在以前是重要的大眾交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為發明了任意門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才被利用為\N觀光的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.93,0:06:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保證絕對安全
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這樣的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣花幾天的時間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣不是很傷腦的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.34,0:06:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為銀河是很寬廣的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你大可不用擔心這些
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.68,0:06:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論去哪里都可用任意門回家
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以白天去學校\N晚上就去宇宙旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你覺得如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.12,0:06:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你 小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.35,0:06:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜晚怎么不趕快來呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到銀河底端了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:52.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先尋找沒有住生物的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:59.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個星球只有巖石\N沒有多細胞生物
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:02.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 馬上設立基地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.55,0:07:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牙膏、牙刷、毛巾、零食和漫畫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:13.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要帶那些東西的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別忘了關燈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.16,0:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,窗戶也關起來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.03,0:07:23.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，不要被媽媽發現
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.04,0:07:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車站在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會到后山來等我們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.85,0:07:39.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的會來這里接我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對，剛好晚上12點的時候到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空中鐵道是很準確的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.93,0:07:47.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心臟跳得好快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.99,0:07:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 興奮的說不出話來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.06,0:07:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好像在作夢喔
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 別睡著啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里這里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的在空中行走嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀 很帥吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.54,0:08:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快坐上去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.57,0:08:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是7號車廂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:40.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.52,0:08:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 您好\N- 您好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.69,0:08:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇，這什么東西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面比從外面看起來要大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是特別空間有5間單人房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.23,0:08:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有會議室
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.06,0:09:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面設施都能用嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車長 從地球上車的有2個喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.27,0:09:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像沒人在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 要開車了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車長、司機都不在\N但列車在移動著耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:10:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看地球變成那樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.67,0:10:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.57,0:10:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒跟他們打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:14.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關系的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.57,0:10:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可是有買車票的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:19.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜他們若來了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.31,0:10:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有5間房間嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早知道就請他們也來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.82,0:10:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就今晚享受一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要哪間房間?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.72,0:10:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要1號房
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我選旁邊的2號房
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么待會兒見
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.99,0:10:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 里面這么寬咧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有床啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.30,0:10:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:44.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝您乘坐本列車
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要您喝了這瓶宇宙飲料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.57,0:10:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論在宇宙的任何溫度環境下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.51,0:10:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您都能舒舒服服的適應它
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以在宇宙生存的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.75,0:10:57.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?這個按鍵是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.95,0:11:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 可以看見外面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:04.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 紅色星星
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是火星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么快就不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么快就不見了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.63,0:11:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要去展望車廂看看?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.13,0:11:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，要去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展望車廂在哪兒呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.07,0:11:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在58號車廂 所以嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,58號車廂?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從外面看只有8個車廂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但實際上這列車有120個車廂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.14,0:11:25.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有120個車廂呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.41,0:11:31.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去展望車廂\N就像參加運動會一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等、等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑慢一點兒嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看窗戶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.87,0:11:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一個忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙里怎么會有忍者呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:12:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是太累了吧，看到幻象了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來，竹蜻蜓給你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.48,0:12:04.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么不早點拿出來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.42,0:12:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過在車廂里用竹蜻蜓真好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.02,0:12:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么豪華的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.06,0:12:12.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里就是展望車廂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.72,0:12:14.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:15.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:17.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.36,0:12:18.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.86,0:12:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想給宜靜看看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:24.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去后可以說給她聽啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是木星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.87,0:12:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木星? 好大唷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是太陽系里最大的惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:42.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球來的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.52,0:12:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請讓我看看你們的車票
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.99,0:12:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是車長嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么到現在才出現啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.69,0:12:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為總公司叫我回去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他大約還有600位的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為旅途遙遠
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以現在在房間里休息
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.84,0:13:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是用任意門出去辦事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要喝點果汁?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.75,0:13:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要用餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也可以送到房間里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.15,0:13:15.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.17,0:13:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木星通過了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始時空跳躍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:38.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.44,0:13:40.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會維持一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:42.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回房間去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:43.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從這兒開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會出現特殊效果星際影像
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.00,0:13:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好困喲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.25,0:13:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好困喲 下一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.69,0:13:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這么決定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.86,0:13:52.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們回房間了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:14:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去展望車廂看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有其他的客人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:04.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.21,0:14:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小便后睡覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.74,0:14:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也附有浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是豪華啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.59,0:14:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看鏡子里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.73,0:14:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.66,0:14:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛有人在呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你再仔細看看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人都沒有呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.34,0:14:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那在別的房間睡吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托，讓我和你一起睡
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.31,0:14:48.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他還有很多房間啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.65,0:14:49.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個人睡太可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會睡不著的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你有點分寸好不好?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.70,0:15:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，起來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.70,0:15:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家啰
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.64,0:15:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再讓我睡一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:14.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學校會遲到喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.67,0:15:16.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 學校
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.34,0:15:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下課后再來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.51,0:15:24.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，起來了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.62,0:15:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像全包下來的一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:37.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又舒服，服務又好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從展望車看出去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.53,0:15:40.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,木星、土星真是漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真期待今天晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.14,0:15:47.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的旅行團是今天晚上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:49.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，請期待著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.45,0:15:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么你們兩個都不說話呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:16:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有意見的話\N說出來不就得了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.62,0:16:03.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們一定認為\N早知道就應該去那里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不對?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.75,0:16:05.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就去呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一個人也可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:08.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但相反的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再認為我們是朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.30,0:16:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真討厭
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下，阿福
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.83,0:16:17.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰唆！真啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么他那么生氣呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！我去拜托大雄看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:32.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.82,0:16:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好朋友 其實有事要麻煩你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，正等你們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快進來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，還是先拒絕阿福再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.03,0:16:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別管那家伙了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.60,0:16:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽，我們要商討功課的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.57,0:16:51.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要吵我們喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.97,0:16:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打擾了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.50,0:16:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:55.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么晚了還要研究功課
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:16:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.01,0:16:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我們是瞞著阿福來的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 嗨！\N- 哇！你這家伙...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先來了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反叛者
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.35,0:17:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還不是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 揍死你\N- 不要吵了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里就是銀河超特急
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是列車里頭?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:22.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像飯店喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.33,0:17:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去向車長付帳
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.47,0:17:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先進去房間里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要5號房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我4號房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.81,0:17:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我3號房
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行李放好后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.15,0:17:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就去展望車廂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在會議室等你們喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一定會嚇一大跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.87,0:17:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！技安
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:18:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?有西部牛仔?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種家伙交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，沒有人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.04,0:18:09.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛明明開槍了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.51,0:18:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用手槍
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.65,0:18:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么，大驚小怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.25,0:18:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的開槍了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.69,0:18:22.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍者、鏡中人、西部牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.83,0:18:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經準備好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去展望車廂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.77,0:18:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也找另外兩個人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.17,0:18:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們先去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.77,0:18:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在正有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.48,0:18:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有立體電動耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這列車的服務真好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特意跑來這里卻不去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.32,0:18:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜真替人著想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.16,0:18:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展望車廂很遠嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:18:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.23,0:19:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個車廂就是展望車廂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:06.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何?這么漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.97,0:19:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的景色?在哪兒?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.21,0:19:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展望車廂不見
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，到底是怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.21,0:19:15.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不曉得呀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.69,0:19:26.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，振作一點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.09,0:19:27.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?我幫他看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心，輕微腦震蕩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微讓他躺一下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會醒的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么突然變亮了呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.67,0:19:46.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新生的宇宙爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.08,0:19:46.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.94,0:19:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊假想畫像
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.11,0:19:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大銀河誕生的開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.15,0:19:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車進入超時空跳躍時
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.98,0:19:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會顯像出來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.15,0:19:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你醒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.26,0:20:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,展望車廂喲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.33,0:20:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是特殊想像畫像
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙時代
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.77,0:20:13.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,持續了10萬年
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的銀河是處女座
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.04,0:20:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全搞不懂在說什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回房去玩電動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想多待一會兒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:32.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我去找小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.99,0:20:38.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比昨晚熱鬧多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當去哪了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.63,0:20:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.40,0:20:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么出現了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.77,0:20:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海...賊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.87,0:20:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,海賊?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.57,0:20:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊，剛剛看到海賊的出現
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.85,0:20:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也看到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.75,0:21:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...技安
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐...恐龍出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.12,0:21:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龍?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.46,0:21:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把玻璃打破探進頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:09.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.93,0:21:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能還在也說不定
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人在呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.17,0:21:18.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里的窗戶被打破了呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:20.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.17,0:21:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的看到了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.37,0:21:23.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不相信我就揍你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.47,0:21:25.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人說不相信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.18,0:21:28.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛剛也說\N看到了西部牛仔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也看到了海賊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快通知小叮當去查查看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.52,0:21:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.99,0:21:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒看到小叮當嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒來這里喲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.13,0:21:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那會去哪兒呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.10,0:21:54.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.81,0:21:57.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.44,0:21:58.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去哪里了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.51,0:21:59.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在找你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.08,0:22:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詳細情形到會議室再說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.52,0:22:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什么事情?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.58,0:22:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 發生什么事\N- 有事嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.15,0:22:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.39,0:22:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總公司來了一個緊急通知
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.99,0:22:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?盜賊團?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.30,0:22:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對！神秘黑色影團
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.17,0:22:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨著宇宙邊緣的運轉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪者將無人的小惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當作基地
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.80,0:22:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用海賊船來到處搗亂發威
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.54,0:22:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒聽說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.11,0:22:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還一直相信這是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很安全的旅行團呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.15,0:22:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在我們該怎么辦呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.11,0:22:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到房間里鎖上房門
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向上天祈禱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.45,0:22:43.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虧你們還敢邀請我們來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.65,0:22:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.92,0:22:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可不是我拜托你們來的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.96,0:22:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.79,0:22:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想回家
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，對了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.83,0:22:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可以用任意門回去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.90,0:23:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.07,0:23:02.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么沒想到這一點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.11,0:23:03.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色影團若來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.11,0:23:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要車長及旅客都不在的話
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.54,0:23:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們也沒辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.74,0:23:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等黑色影團通過了銀河后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.05,0:23:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們再來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.08,0:23:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么請吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.86,0:23:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,門里的超空間
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被黑色影團給上鎖了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是他們做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.80,0:23:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人能從這個列車逃出去
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車好像從時空跳躍
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出來到宇宙了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車全速前進通過小惑星群
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會持續急轉彎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.92,0:23:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:05.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到底會變成怎樣呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.34,0:24:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，各位
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.54,0:24:13.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不覺得\N終于變得有趣了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.98,0:24:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們從以前都一直冒險過來
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.35,0:24:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論遇到什么都會奮戰到底
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.08,0:24:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次也是一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.32,0:24:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃，跟他們拼到底吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄每次都會忽然講一些
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.39,0:24:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很帥氣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.46,0:24:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,講得好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.03,0:24:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們如果進攻過來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.39,0:24:31.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們就拼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.20,0:24:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.63,0:24:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟壞人拼了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.17,0:24:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿透環
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.77,0:24:45.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和大雄到車頂察看
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.01,0:24:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.91,0:24:51.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.85,0:24:53.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.15,0:24:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以竹蜻蜓是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.85,0:24:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.45,0:24:56.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.29,0:24:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄小心點喲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.72,0:25:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我記得有一樣好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.69,0:25:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,止滑手套和鞋子
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿上就沒問題了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.26,0:25:08.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這好像青蛙一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.37,0:25:10.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧，到前面看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.24,0:25:21.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，有人在那兒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.78,0:25:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，車長
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人，很危險的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.69,0:25:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你在這里\N列車行進沒問題嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.59,0:25:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是自動運行的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.19,0:25:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位也來乘涼的嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:40.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是剛剛的...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是巴姆
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.17,0:25:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是報社記者
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.97,0:25:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.97,0:25:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是貓型機器人小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請指教
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.37,0:25:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,報社記者為何在這列車上?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不容易來度假
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.35,0:25:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卻遭遇到這種事情
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.45,0:26:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星星在發光
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:02.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里一個
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.39,0:26:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里也有
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.62,0:26:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一個一個星星的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.39,0:26:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都躲著黑色影團
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.42,0:26:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,互相發出信號
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.83,0:26:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下就會攻過來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.76,0:26:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有炮彈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.86,0:26:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是信號彈而已
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.30,0:26:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但總比沒有得好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.54,0:26:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.72,0:26:35.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我來
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.89,0:26:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可不是玩具呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然大雄沒有其他優點
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.02,0:26:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但卻是射擊的天才喲
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.57,0:26:50.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.20,0:26:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但其他飛船攻過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.07,0:26:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被攻擊的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.54,0:26:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快想辦法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問我，我也...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.42,0:27:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.76,0:27:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但無止境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被包圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.41,0:27:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能控制了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.01,0:27:38.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會被那星星吸進去
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.07,0:27:57.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怎樣了?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.77,0:27:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.20,0:28:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是天國?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.77,0:28:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.91,0:28:07.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車好像沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.41,0:28:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛的騷動不知是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.65,0:28:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.70,0:28:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 技安
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.25,0:28:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.85,0:28:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色影團在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.56,0:28:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知消失到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.52,0:28:21.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.89,0:28:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若打過來的話
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.73,0:28:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正打算攻回去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.80,0:28:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真沒干勁的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.33,0:28:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還不能掉以輕心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:33.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們可能馬上就攻過來
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.07,0:28:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胡說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.87,0:28:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是什么地方\N小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.44,0:28:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道呀
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.34,0:28:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去車長那里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.28,0:28:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請求警備隊支援
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.38,0:28:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑色影團又來了?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.68,0:28:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，這是煙火
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.79,0:28:50.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.86,0:28:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽得到音樂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.76,0:28:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 影像越來越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.66,0:28:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.53,0:29:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是宇宙中最大、最新\N最棒的夢幻樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.57,0:29:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢幻樂園?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.44,0:29:11.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.48,0:29:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾聽說銀河外蓋有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.41,0:29:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主題樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.45,0:29:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.22,0:29:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最開始的節目列車強盜秀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位覺得好玩嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.42,0:29:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.72,0:29:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛剛的是秀啰?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.76,0:29:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎沒察覺到呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.46,0:29:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為死了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢幻樂園為附近的小學生們
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.93,0:29:36.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備有忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.37,0:29:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西部星球及恐龍星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.80,0:29:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各種的冒險游戲
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.77,0:29:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.78,0:29:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是列車的實況轉播
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.91,0:29:50.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龍的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.08,0:29:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.25,0:29:53.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.15,0:29:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么多人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.22,0:30:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說有600人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.73,0:30:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.59,0:30:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們的打扮很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.16,0:30:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久以前的打扮呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.40,0:30:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是以前的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.77,0:30:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.80,0:30:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是從20世紀來的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊? 20世紀?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.04,0:30:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難怪穿著落伍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.41,0:30:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是以前的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在電視上看過的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.81,0:30:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20世紀的人是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.05,0:30:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住在洞窟里呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.92,0:30:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用石頭做的穴吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.28,0:30:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會...\N鐵之類的東西已經在用了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.55,0:30:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些家伙 欺負人呀
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.16,0:30:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.42,0:30:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.39,0:30:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在要進入夢幻樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.33,0:30:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請先回列車上 先回列車上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.13,0:31:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.40,0:31:17.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比小惑星里較高等的星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然有很多生命體闖進來
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么集團呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.34,0:31:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么目的?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.54,0:31:27.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓間諜去查查看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.55,0:31:30.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.51,0:31:31.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.53,0:31:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車自動降落
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.63,0:31:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是方便呀
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.07,0:31:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.04,0:31:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.20,0:31:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳說中的怪獸星球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.14,0:31:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.01,0:32:00.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個也蠻好玩的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.28,0:32:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.88,0:32:02.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.61,0:32:03.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再去...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.38,0:32:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好！去西部星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么?去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.82,0:32:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但西部星球...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.99,0:32:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福也想去忍者星球，對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:16.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.83,0:32:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 二比一
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.43,0:32:20.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就決定去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.50,0:32:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也要問一下宜靜呀
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.90,0:32:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.27,0:32:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，去哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.80,0:32:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！任意門
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.41,0:32:32.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜有重要的事先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.18,0:32:33.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.04,0:32:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己喜歡去哪個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.18,0:32:36.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就去哪個星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.01,0:32:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐小飛機的話
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.65,0:32:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以自由的去繞了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.48,0:32:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎不早說呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.99,0:32:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，我...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.99,0:32:45.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.79,0:32:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.32,0:32:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.63,0:32:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.53,0:32:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留個話給宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.63,0:32:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安和阿福去忍者星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.50,0:32:58.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和大雄去西部星球
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.17,0:32:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜也趕快來
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.57,0:33:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你來喲
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.91,0:33:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.04,0:33:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里借小飛機呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.11,0:33:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從這直走約2公里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.41,0:33:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 2公里?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.55,0:33:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真遠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.25,0:33:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不方便
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.85,0:33:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.89,0:33:19.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在做什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.96,0:33:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油呀
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.46,0:33:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂什么是軸承路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.66,0:33:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，對了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,軸承路
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.43,0:33:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是軸承路?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.07,0:33:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看看路面
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.40,0:33:34.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是用小圓球做的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.04,0:33:36.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要利用圓球上回轉力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.54,0:33:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,速度就會變得很快的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.37,0:33:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.25,0:33:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重量波推進飛機
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.36,0:33:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各種式樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.79,0:33:56.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這架如何?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.43,0:33:58.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也會操縱嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.73,0:34:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 這是全自動的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.30,0:34:02.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以操縱沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.23,0:34:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但請不要去“禁斷星球”
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.67,0:34:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.80,0:34:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,導游手冊也提到過
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.10,0:34:11.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么請慢慢享用
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.21,0:34:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西部星球，出發
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.12,0:34:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“禁斷星球”是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.89,0:34:28.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前曾有人在那挖掘礦石
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.86,0:34:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是無人星球\N到處都是坑洞
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.66,0:34:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很危險的 現在禁止進入
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.01,0:34:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨槍煙城市
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.51,0:34:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是市長柯林頓.依斯.吳頓
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.05,0:34:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上，今天我們要從各位中選出
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.55,0:35:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本市的警長
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.16,0:35:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在射擊大會即將開始
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.63,0:35:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將會選出警長的助手
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.93,0:35:11.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警長助手是最能夠享有\N警長的各種名譽的人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.07,0:35:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么各位請到飯店里換衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.80,0:35:19.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 然后到會場集合\N- 警長?我好想...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.08,0:35:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射擊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是有自信的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.41,0:35:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，古代人也來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.75,0:35:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弓箭應比手槍更適合吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.75,0:35:26.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.85,0:35:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等著瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.02,0:35:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何?適合我嗎?\N很有架勢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.13,0:35:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像西部牛仔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里頭裝有真的子彈?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.76,0:35:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.70,0:35:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這上面寫的是
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.97,0:35:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果打到壞角色的機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會停在機器人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.17,0:35:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但打到人的話
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.91,0:35:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會變得輕飄飄的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.94,0:35:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在空中浮上來
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.94,0:35:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以是很安全的子彈
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.64,0:35:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我將成為警長
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.58,0:36:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會場在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.02,0:36:02.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,候選人請到這兒來集合
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,標的物是這六個空瓶及空罐
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.22,0:36:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請聽我的哨聲后開始射擊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.12,0:36:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6發里面 只要中2發就合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.59,0:36:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一位請就位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.60,0:36:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.57,0:36:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像很強的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.00,0:36:19.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起來就像西部的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.90,0:36:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.34,0:36:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨時奉陪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.68,0:36:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只中1發 不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.85,0:36:34.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個中心沒偏歪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.52,0:36:36.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒這回事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.72,0:36:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.42,0:36:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.72,0:36:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對是歪的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.99,0:36:46.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中2發
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.20,0:36:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.13,0:36:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.20,0:36:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，換我了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.37,0:36:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.90,0:36:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要全都打中喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.51,0:36:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部沒打中 不合格 下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.88,0:37:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.35,0:37:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打到我了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.05,0:37:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.12,0:37:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.28,0:37:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.85,0:37:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交給我了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.55,0:37:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.69,0:37:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中5發
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前的最高者
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.16,0:37:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格！
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.13,0:37:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小意思嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.40,0:37:23.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.37,0:37:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會是警長啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.77,0:37:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不及格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.14,0:37:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.91,0:37:33.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中3發
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.11,0:37:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.84,0:37:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一位
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.78,0:37:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 輪到古代人了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.31,0:37:38.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家躲好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.45,0:37:40.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子彈會飛到哪里可不知道唷
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.72,0:37:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨你們笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.99,0:37:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很難每個都中
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.62,0:37:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是集中一個目標的話\N我可是很厲害的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:52.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只中1發
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.73,0:37:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.23,0:37:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不合格 果然是古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.50,0:38:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請仔細看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.51,0:38:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6個洞
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.01,0:38:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子彈在罐子里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.14,0:38:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,6發全中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.75,0:38:11.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,合格
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.81,0:38:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害喔
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.69,0:38:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在舉行各位警長助手的\N任命儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.39,0:38:22.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請各位維持秩序
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.19,0:38:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和罪犯挑戰
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.56,0:38:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓槍煙城市成為\N永遠和平的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.93,0:38:29.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.00,0:38:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,授予徽章
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.67,0:38:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(警長)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.37,0:38:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄很適合你唷
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.44,0:38:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.67,0:38:38.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.11,0:38:38.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.91,0:38:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會成為警長的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.45,0:38:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.51,0:38:46.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也好想當呀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.22,0:38:46.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等著
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等著
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.98,0:38:49.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會成為警長的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.55,0:38:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來要做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.72,0:38:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能在哪里\N有人會發動暴動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.19,0:39:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了，銀行強盜
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.66,0:39:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.60,0:39:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.07,0:39:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.31,0:39:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.91,0:39:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與其開槍\N跟在后面追比較快
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.75,0:39:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當 竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.01,0:39:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.95,0:39:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 違反規則
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.72,0:39:23.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在西部星球里使用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.75,0:39:27.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的客人會說話的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.12,0:39:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.03,0:39:30.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閃開，別擋路
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.93,0:39:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.86,0:39:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別在那里拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.43,0:39:36.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.10,0:39:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去“OK牧場”騎馬
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.43,0:39:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.87,0:39:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然它是最乖巧的...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.27,0:39:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,適合我們的只有這匹了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.14,0:39:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.24,0:39:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我們趕到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.88,0:39:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天都黑了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.81,0:39:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據這張手冊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.25,0:39:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西部有個叫“死亡山谷”里面
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.02,0:39:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有強盜集團
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.00,0:40:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(死亡山谷)
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.83,0:40:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人來了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.57,0:40:11.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.87,0:40:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方有4個人\N只有我一人脫逃
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.07,0:40:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有沒有關系呀
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.84,0:40:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個鐘頭后就會落地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.71,0:40:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好像都被打中了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.32,0:40:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,古代人
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在還沒被打中前趕快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.89,0:40:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，敵人很接近唷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.19,0:40:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.13,0:40:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.03,0:40:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悄悄地靠近查看情形
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.13,0:40:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這之前被發現就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隱形液體
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.30,0:40:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把它倒到地面就可以鉆進地下了?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.17,0:40:52.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.31,0:40:57.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，分兩路進行
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.05,0:40:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.95,0:41:04.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從窗戶偷偷地看看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.39,0:41:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 有人出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.73,0:41:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人會來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.93,0:41:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一群膽小鬼沒骨氣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.33,0:41:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?怎么會有帽子呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.80,0:41:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 大雄被發現了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.45,0:41:32.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.58,0:41:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是狐貍吧?真稀奇
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.98,0:41:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他腌在罐里頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.32,0:41:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看有沒有其他同黨
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.82,0:41:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他招供
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.46,0:41:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.89,0:41:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 我在這
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.20,0:41:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.30,0:41:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任命大雄是我們城市的\N正義警長
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.84,0:42:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒意思
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.31,0:42:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去別的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.58,0:42:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.05,0:42:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪個星球呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.82,0:42:07.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這神氣的模樣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.72,0:42:09.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想讓宜靜看看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.85,0:42:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有阿福跟技安
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.36,0:42:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍者星球不知道好不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.53,0:42:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這太難啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.43,0:42:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不想來忍者星球嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.30,0:42:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰唆，再說要掉下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.37,0:42:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.00,0:42:34.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛看著路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.34,0:42:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,修行還不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂忍者就是要對死亡覺悟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.92,0:42:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的苦都要忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.69,0:42:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你教我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.39,0:42:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.99,0:42:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們希望能在空中飛
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.72,0:42:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是學會隱身術等\N較特別的技術
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.50,0:42:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這樣的話
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.33,0:42:56.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如在學校上體育課
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.57,0:43:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在的小孩真沒耐性
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.37,0:43:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，我們去別的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.77,0:43:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.07,0:43:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.74,0:43:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你們沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.88,0:43:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只好傳授你們臨時證
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.21,0:43:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳授臨時證?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.85,0:43:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傳授你們這個臨時證
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.85,0:43:18.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是為了讓忍者修行成績良好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.09,0:43:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使用此卷軸能成穿墻隱形人
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.86,0:43:24.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用這個卷軸能成穿墻隱形人?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.26,0:43:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何使用?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.23,0:43:30.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里頭有輸入念力的電腦程式
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.27,0:43:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要含在嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.17,0:43:32.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心里想著 就可以穿墻
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.84,0:43:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爬墻之術 隱身之術
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.21,0:43:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且能夠變成老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.81,0:43:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣而已?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.28,0:43:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,臨時證就是這樣而已啦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.21,0:43:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.98,0:43:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.35,0:43:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了，技安
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.05,0:43:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.26,0:43:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么接受測驗看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.93,0:43:56.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過了的話
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.69,0:43:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能拿到真正的證明唷
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.76,0:44:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,深入那座城去找秘密的文件
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.70,0:44:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正式的證書可以用在\N很多的法術上嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.47,0:44:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.37,0:44:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的法術都輸入在里頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.34,0:44:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.24,0:44:13.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.54,0:44:15.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,期待拿到忍者證書
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.22,0:44:23.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.39,0:44:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有守衛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.25,0:44:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那走這邊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.43,0:44:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用穿墻術就可輕松鉆進來了\N我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.40,0:44:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密文件在哪里呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.38,0:44:47.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可疑者
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.01,0:44:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓起來
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.84,0:44:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.65,0:44:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,變成老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.62,0:44:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別逃
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.85,0:45:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能用法術真好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.92,0:45:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.22,0:45:04.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！有寫著秘書之房
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.39,0:45:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密文件應該藏在這里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.83,0:45:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的房間呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.27,0:45:10.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.03,0:45:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊放著一個什么東西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.60,0:45:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.07,0:45:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.20,0:45:15.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘書之箱
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.14,0:45:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.41,0:45:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么簡單就拿到啦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.11,0:45:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是新手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.42,0:45:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那么簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.92,0:45:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,10年后再來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.02,0:45:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.83,0:45:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳輸了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.93,0:45:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.16,0:45:43.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話星球是少女喜歡的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.47,0:45:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是女孩子嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.37,0:45:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨童話星球
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.85,0:46:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.38,0:46:02.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這么大的彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.82,0:46:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到啦，真啰唆
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.09,0:46:08.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么東西飛過來了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會是侯鳥呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.36,0:46:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天馬，是天馬群
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.50,0:46:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯耶
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.57,0:46:18.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.23,0:46:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們好
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.80,0:46:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辦公室在那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.07,0:46:24.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在童話星球里
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.47,0:46:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你將成為童話中的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.04,0:46:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有各種不同的游戲\N讓你親身體驗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.65,0:46:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如灰姑娘、拇指姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.55,0:46:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.82,0:46:37.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要參加白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.59,0:46:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.75,0:46:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主是最受歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.56,0:46:41.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要排隊等
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.76,0:46:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.66,0:46:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是狐貍秀
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.96,0:46:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就可進場
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.53,0:46:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.63,0:46:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么請再等3次
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.23,0:46:51.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊的兩位客人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.53,0:46:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要當王子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.50,0:46:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.60,0:46:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.51,0:46:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.91,0:47:00.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先吃熱狗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.54,0:47:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.31,0:47:03.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在等待的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.58,0:47:04.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果覺得無聊的話
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.58,0:47:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以先到前面去見習 如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.33,0:47:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話故事的現場到了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.83,0:47:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.90,0:47:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻璃棺木有7具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.27,0:47:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為參加者太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.07,0:47:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一次用7個白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.64,0:47:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同時進行
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.41,0:47:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 王子來了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.31,0:47:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子，請救救白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.75,0:47:41.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.18,0:47:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么? 7個白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.79,0:47:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子，傷腦筋呀...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.02,0:47:49.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.66,0:47:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.56,0:47:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.66,0:47:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正在等著你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.30,0:47:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去我城堡里好嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.43,0:47:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.40,0:48:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我也等好久了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.94,0:48:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.61,0:48:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎能只選一個公主
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.98,0:48:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等了5次了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.41,0:48:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎么辦呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.31,0:48:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣你也要參加嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.85,0:48:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.39,0:48:20.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話星球是很無趣的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.72,0:48:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次換我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.39,0:48:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去恐龍星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.66,0:48:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去和恐龍對決
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.73,0:48:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊好像有個生命體
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.80,0:48:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,附到其中一個人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.77,0:48:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓一個人來
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.70,0:48:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憑你也想當公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.28,0:48:45.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對吧 阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.05,0:48:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么啦?阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.10,0:48:47.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然間安靜下來
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.02,0:48:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯達你不要緊嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.95,0:48:53.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我的身體呀
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.29,0:48:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好久沒有進入新的生命體了\N- 阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.02,0:49:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么了\N- 你搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.57,0:49:11.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.91,0:49:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總司令部，我是008號
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.14,0:49:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已進入人體里成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.55,0:49:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 在小惑星里\N有好幾百人蠢動著
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.49,0:49:25.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正等著你的指令
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.99,0:49:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是總司令部
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.32,0:49:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,008號真厲害，辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.03,0:49:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來馬上進行第2個動作
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.86,0:49:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進入每一個人的身體里
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.53,0:49:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去習慣人體 等待指令
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.87,0:49:42.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,準備好了后 發動總攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.80,0:49:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后可以把整個星球占據下來了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.48,0:49:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后被星球的武士抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.78,0:49:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我們關在地下道
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.05,0:49:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用穿墻術才好不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.96,0:50:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.12,0:50:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話星球也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.36,0:50:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以如果去西部星球就好了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.20,0:50:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天一起去中世紀的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.30,0:50:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐龍星球啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.17,0:50:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是好可怕呀\N恐龍會攻擊我們的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.11,0:50:20.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒問題 是休閑樂園，很安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.84,0:50:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么為了明天 今晚要好好睡一覺
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.09,0:50:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,華麗邊際的星球\N是屬于太陽系的小惑星
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.70,0:50:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由于地方不便
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.16,0:50:44.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前出有礦石而曾轟動一時
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.73,0:50:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為有珍貴的礦石
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.94,0:50:52.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但礦石挖完后
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.24,0:50:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下坑坑洞洞的小星球而已
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.85,0:50:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去工作的人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.81,0:51:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丟下田園到城市去了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.29,0:51:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣下去的話
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.39,0:51:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些邊際星球會消滅的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:12.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夢幻樂園是我們\N討論了好幾次的結果
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.76,0:51:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.70,0:51:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才蓋了夢幻樂園
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.37,0:51:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.20,0:51:20.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邊際星球所有人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.47,0:51:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對于殘留的星球做的賭注
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.51,0:51:25.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果巴姆能把這里一流的器材
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.94,0:51:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及漂亮的景色
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.61,0:51:30.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,登在新聞上 讓大家知道的話
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.01,0:51:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，等我取材后
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.82,0:51:34.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定會登在報紙上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.35,0:51:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要確認的是安全性的問題
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.55,0:51:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多樂園里\N有許多的機器壞掉的毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.86,0:51:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,客人會發生危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.89,0:51:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是絕對不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.03,0:51:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那棟建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.23,0:51:49.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.93,0:51:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天24小時都會
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,守著周圍的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.80,0:51:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大如恐龍星球 小如妖精
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.54,0:52:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但萬一發生事故時...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.68,0:52:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那中心的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.44,0:52:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個通信燈塔\N可以發出求救信號
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.35,0:52:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一有什么問題\N本部的警衛隊就會馬上趕來
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.82,0:52:16.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么明天開始
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.53,0:52:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會去各地探訪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.23,0:52:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請慢慢探訪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.86,0:52:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我送你\N- 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.33,0:52:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.04,0:52:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，好晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.07,0:52:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?那些發光體是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.71,0:52:34.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是流星吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.18,0:52:37.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這附近的天空有很多星屑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.78,0:52:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.02,0:52:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不客氣，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.15,0:52:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.43,0:52:52.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.59,0:52:55.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上開始行動
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.26,0:52:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,個別去找一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:59.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把自己放進去習慣人體
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.33,0:53:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目標是控制中心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.97,0:53:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,及通訊中心的人
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.14,0:53:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要讓機器人混亂
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.04,0:53:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.75,0:53:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是去通信室的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.78,0:53:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,001號行動
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.70,0:53:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.70,0:53:32.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.87,0:53:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什么，只是跌倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.80,0:53:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么交班了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.34,0:53:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果生病的話不要勉強唷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.17,0:53:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.94,0:53:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.41,0:53:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身分確認
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.98,0:53:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指紋確認
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.02,0:53:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.49,0:53:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開門
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.43,0:53:58.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就破壞這里的設備
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.99,0:54:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邊際星球就沒得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.07,0:54:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.03,0:54:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 部長在叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:10.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有發光體掉落地面
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.87,0:54:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請保安隊調查
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.54,0:54:14.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是！馬上聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.01,0:54:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋人類
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.81,0:54:20.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,末日到了還不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.39,0:54:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當，起來了嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.42,0:54:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.00,0:54:31.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起來了 早安
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.76,0:54:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.76,0:54:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，好早呀 現在馬上準備
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.93,0:54:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這之前有事想麻煩你
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.47,0:54:43.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?要任意門\N做什么用?回家嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.41,0:54:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 洗澡\N- 啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.21,0:54:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚沒法洗嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.11,0:54:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么呀，最里面的房間是浴室啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.81,0:54:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.05,0:54:58.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈，宜靜就是宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.29,0:55:02.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出發可能還要一段時間
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.02,0:55:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.29,0:55:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去恐龍星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.33,0:55:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.70,0:55:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.63,0:55:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發前洗澡?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.50,0:55:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在星際中洗澡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.90,0:55:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真棒的露天澡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.55,0:55:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！真失禮！
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.85,0:55:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是夢幻樂園的機器人?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.39,0:55:37.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是幽浮玩具?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.59,0:55:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是色狼幽浮呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.90,0:55:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若說是玩具
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.13,0:55:43.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得很精致啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.43,0:55:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種東西等一下再說
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.63,0:55:46.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.57,0:55:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.77,0:55:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.51,0:55:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 巴姆先生
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.28,0:55:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.21,0:56:01.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要和我們一起去恐龍星球?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.52,0:56:02.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.85,0:56:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不到各地探訪是不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.52,0:56:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.66,0:56:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.76,0:56:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.23,0:56:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是大冒險的開始喔
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.95,0:56:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這中生代的星球里
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.78,0:56:31.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代表著三疊紀，侏羅紀及\N白亞紀時期的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.75,0:56:34.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像古時候一樣地生活著
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.79,0:56:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位請自由地探險
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.36,0:56:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一天靠近自己喜歡的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.09,0:56:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和他們培養感情成為朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.13,0:56:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以像好朋友般乘坐自如后
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.93,0:56:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二天便可參加賽龍
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.74,0:56:51.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說騎恐龍競賽啰
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.81,0:56:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從山腳到海邊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.31,0:56:58.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冠軍獎品是讓你\N選擇自己喜歡的恐龍帶回家
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.11,0:57:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要最大的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.65,0:57:02.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 你要放哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.38,0:57:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！對喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.98,0:57:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問 有暴龍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.15,0:57:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然有
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.66,0:57:10.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會攻擊我們嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.36,0:57:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那當然
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道會被吃掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.23,0:57:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！會把你吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.23,0:57:19.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后會變成怎樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.17,0:57:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在肚子里變成化石然后吐出來
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.60,0:57:24.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說游戲結束
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.37,0:57:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是個問題啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.54,0:57:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請放心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.44,0:57:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接待員會將你們恢復原狀的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.90,0:57:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.71,0:57:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么說，還是小心點才好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.22,0:57:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這里可以用竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.75,0:57:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想和可愛的恐龍成為朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.49,0:57:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要大的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.96,0:57:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據這個導游裝置
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.63,0:57:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在這附近好像有劍龍
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.27,0:57:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.07,0:57:59.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是在這附近的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.81,0:58:00.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.77,0:58:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.57,0:58:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 在哪里?\N- 哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.57,0:58:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.18,0:58:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.72,0:58:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，不要站在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.09,0:58:14.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來這邊嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.52,0:58:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劍龍是草食動物
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.26,0:58:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摸他也沒關系唷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.13,0:58:20.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會咬人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.26,0:58:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對！很乖的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.06,0:58:23.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這家伙不動耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.46,0:58:24.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是在睡覺呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.96,0:58:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來試試看
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.20,0:58:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別這樣呀
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.77,0:58:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劍龍不適合賽龍耶
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.21,0:58:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也對
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.88,0:58:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還是找小只一點的比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.38,0:58:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們各自去找自己喜歡的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.35,0:58:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這么辦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.92,0:58:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.99,0:58:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 如果有什么事情的話
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.49,0:58:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就用這個導游裝置聯絡
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.19,0:58:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.23,0:58:53.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，阿福 走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.99,0:58:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要聯絡唷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.94,0:59:06.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什么要出現耶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.62,0:59:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是迅猛龍 很兇暴的肉食恐龍
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.42,0:59:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,長的不是很高大嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.35,0:59:24.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是頭腦相當好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.99,0:59:28.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如說，利用其中一只恐龍\N去分散目標物的注意力后
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.66,0:59:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的恐龍\N再悄悄的從后方攻擊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.70,0:59:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.14,0:59:46.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是三犄龍
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.98,0:59:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然可愛但是跑不快啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.98,0:59:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子不餓嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.99,0:59:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先填飽肚子再找吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.59,0:59:54.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.06,0:59:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快飽糖
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.42,0:59:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有香腸口味，真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.96,1:00:03.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 只要吃一粒就覺得很飽了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.13,1:00:06.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有技安喜歡的暴龍就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么? 是小恐龍耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.01,1:00:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是只黏人的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.15,1:00:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！這不能吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.32,1:00:25.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！我討厭瘦小的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.79,1:00:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜歡大恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.63,1:00:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，你看這個腳印
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.90,1:00:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！這可是大恐龍唷
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.10,1:00:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.63,1:00:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，在這里，在這！
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.07,1:00:46.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.54,1:00:48.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是脕龍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.45,1:00:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是在找這么大的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.89,1:01:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這才適合我呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.49,1:01:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大并不表示跑的快唷
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.29,1:01:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.79,1:01:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和螞蟻，狗啦 比起來的話
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.13,1:01:09.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰會贏?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.23,1:01:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然這樣 但要怎么坐上去呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.47,1:01:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 我要去找別的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.07,1:01:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么好辦法呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.17,1:01:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不想放棄呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.55,1:01:27.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！想到了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.61,1:01:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.58,1:01:29.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.75,1:01:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你來當我的助手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.52,1:01:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.82,1:01:36.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 為何它的脖子\N轉向是那樣的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.52,1:01:38.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.52,1:01:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是他的事呀
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.43,1:01:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這你就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.16,1:01:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他只吃嫩葉的關系
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.90,1:01:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.07,1:01:48.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以趕快去幫我找綠葉嫩芽
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.70,1:01:49.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.87,1:01:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的，只顧到自己
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.71,1:01:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多找一點啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.94,1:02:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收集好了就拿到脕龍嘴邊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.58,1:02:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當作誘餌吸引他
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.62,1:02:11.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.09,1:02:15.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跑快一點
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.19,1:02:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想騎恐龍啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.80,1:02:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.07,1:02:23.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像這樣繼續走
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.94,1:02:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有點分寸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.44,1:02:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大家有沒有\N找到自己喜歡的恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.68,1:02:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！好可愛
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.55,1:02:37.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也想吃是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.62,1:02:43.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.16,1:02:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能騎\N我只好找其他的恐龍了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.63,1:02:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起啦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.20,1:02:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟著來了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.63,1:02:55.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但吃太多是不好的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.84,1:03:02.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！有大恐龍
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.04,1:03:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會是壞恐龍?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.51,1:03:07.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種是鴨嘴龍\N奔跑的速度相當快
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.15,1:03:10.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但個性很溫和
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.48,1:03:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該可以成為好朋友吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.88,1:03:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來，大家吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.33,1:03:27.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找不到喜歡的恐龍耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.97,1:03:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道他們找到喜歡的恐龍了沒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當！翼龍如何呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.71,1:03:38.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不錯耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.68,1:03:41.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是在空中飛的話\N一定是最快的了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.28,1:03:42.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，去試試看
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.79,1:03:45.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.39,1:03:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看，海上有好多喔
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.16,1:03:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在抓魚呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.86,1:03:56.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是，要怎么坐上去呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.83,1:03:58.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之，先試試看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.97,1:04:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.34,1:04:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.54,1:04:13.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很過癮耶
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.38,1:04:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，我也來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.85,1:04:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，我也來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.55,1:04:22.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，如果是翼龍的話\N一定會拿第一名唷
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.53,1:04:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你夠了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.99,1:04:31.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好，繼續加油
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.33,1:04:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,換你來讓他追追看
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.03,1:04:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會是第一名的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.77,1:04:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太難了 這是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.98,1:04:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.11,1:04:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，讓他停下來
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.49,1:04:54.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:54.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.69,1:04:58.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己跑掉了 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.50,1:05:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是暴龍
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.14,1:05:11.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往這里來了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.74,1:05:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么辦
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太重了 飛不起來，放開我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.48,1:05:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想丟下我嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.08,1:05:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！竹蜻蜓...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.02,1:05:30.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.26,1:05:33.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.34,1:05:45.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦！怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.71,1:05:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.04,1:05:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，變熟練了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.21,1:05:54.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向左拉就會往左飛唷
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.38,1:05:55.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當，你看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.25,1:06:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.32,1:06:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.36,1:06:08.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都掉下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.10,1:06:13.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底發生什么事情?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.63,1:06:15.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是機器壞掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.30,1:06:19.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.41,1:06:21.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.21,1:06:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我！暴龍不動了\N到底怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.15,1:06:28.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是因為這樣才得救了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.65,1:06:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說的也是，不過...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.92,1:06:34.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜不知怎么樣了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.02,1:06:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，聯絡看看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.16,1:06:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鴨嘴龍突然都倒下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.39,1:06:40.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什么事情了?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.26,1:06:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那里也一樣?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.53,1:06:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個夢幻樂園的設計真糟糕呀
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.83,1:06:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去問問看
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.87,1:06:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到中央辦公室集合吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.11,1:06:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.31,1:07:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機器人都是由控制中心操縱的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.28,1:07:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么請趕快聯絡把他們修好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.62,1:07:08.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我們剛剛\N已經向通訊塔聯絡了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.49,1:07:11.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是一點回應都沒有...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.59,1:07:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是中生代星球
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.19,1:07:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心，聽到請回答
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.80,1:07:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面騷動起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.04,1:07:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！這是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.31,1:07:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有的機器人\N亂七八糟地動了起來
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.99,1:07:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會變成怎樣呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是中央星球發生什么事了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.83,1:07:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.46,1:07:52.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,控制中心，控制中心\N聽到請回答
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.50,1:07:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家看那里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.31,1:08:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翼龍群攻過來了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.41,1:08:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快坐上去
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.46,1:08:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加速
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.22,1:08:20.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沖出這里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.06,1:08:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會追到宇宙空間來的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.46,1:08:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，加速了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.13,1:08:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像快撞到了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.43,1:08:28.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎?全速前進
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.27,1:08:35.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像甩掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.92,1:08:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是中央星球
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.55,1:08:47.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在好像是晚上
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.29,1:08:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看那里
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.76,1:08:53.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是火災呀?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.50,1:09:07.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中央星球果真發生事情了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.37,1:09:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.09,1:09:23.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,分頭去查查看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.32,1:09:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我和阿福去有煙的地方看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.20,1:09:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事的話 用導游裝置聯絡吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.20,1:09:35.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了，阿福走吧 好
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.17,1:09:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心一點
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.77,1:09:37.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心一點
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.34,1:09:39.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這應該是通訊塔吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.15,1:09:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好，有人在嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.32,1:09:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！被破壞得亂七八糟
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.39,1:09:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火勢變大了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.12,1:09:58.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不趕快逃走的話很危險的 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.49,1:10:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有人在嗎\N- 沒有人的 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.50,1:10:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安 沒人在的話 闖進來不好
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.47,1:10:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要先走嚕
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.37,1:10:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰在那里?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.04,1:10:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.08,1:10:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福！怎么了?阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.58,1:10:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪啊?阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.92,1:10:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么自己跑走了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.86,1:10:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.06,1:10:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屋頂找過了 都沒有人在
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.93,1:10:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翼樓也沒人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.67,1:10:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地下室連一只蟑螂也沒有
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.17,1:10:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎樣了呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.80,1:10:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都躲到哪里去了呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.98,1:10:51.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.88,1:10:54.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.68,1:10:57.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福不見了?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.38,1:11:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，在那邊等著
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.02,1:11:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的，讓人操心的阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.86,1:11:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要突然停下來嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.46,1:11:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噓，有人來了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.23,1:11:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲起來
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.66,1:11:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從游樂園里出來的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.14,1:11:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.01,1:11:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是游樂園的設施
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在到處亂晃著呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.86,1:11:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看天空
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.97,1:11:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多妖魔鬼怪呀
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.80,1:11:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童話星球中的機器人來了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.01,1:11:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.08,1:12:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管了，快去技安那里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.39,1:12:08.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，這里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.52,1:12:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.39,1:12:12.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有阿福的消息?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.19,1:12:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有 到底跑到哪里去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.79,1:12:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非被妖怪拐走了?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.96,1:12:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.37,1:12:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.14,1:12:25.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.10,1:12:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這家伙，突然就消失了\N真讓人操心
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.17,1:12:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.48,1:12:32.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你現在在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.58,1:12:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發現一個\N絕對安全可以隱藏的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.41,1:12:37.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家趕快來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.45,1:12:39.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 在哪里呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.99,1:12:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里好像沒有妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.49,1:12:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此\N躲到那里就不會被發現了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.62,1:12:46.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.94,1:13:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那，在那
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.61,1:13:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.28,1:13:09.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找你找好久啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.05,1:13:11.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家到齊啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.82,1:13:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了！發射
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.19,1:13:21.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要擔心\N只是讓你們睡一下而已
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.46,1:13:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0009號，做得很好
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.70,1:13:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟其他人一樣關到小屋去
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.90,1:13:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再來就算有幾百人也是不夠的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.90,1:13:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有800萬只寄生蟲在指令中心
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.21,1:13:43.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上天兵也要來征服新銀河了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.18,1:13:46.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒水了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.35,1:13:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就喝完了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.32,1:13:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食物也沒有了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.36,1:13:52.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知有沒有人會來救我們
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.86,1:13:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么會有人來呢
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.56,1:13:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.13,1:14:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有個有錢的老爸就這么自傲
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.97,1:14:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真討厭
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.77,1:14:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊\N下次碰到的話要狠狠的咬他
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.47,1:14:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看！那不會是宇宙船吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.91,1:14:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.05,1:14:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.72,1:14:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我們
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.70,1:14:42.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福 居然把我們關在這里
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.11,1:14:44.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我們出去 放我們出去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.51,1:14:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦！安靜一點
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.05,1:14:50.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這家伙，你是阿福耶\N居然靠到敵方去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.85,1:14:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么阿福?我是寄生蟲0009號
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.42,1:14:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說是寄居蟹耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.29,1:14:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄居蟹?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.42,1:15:00.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是寄生蟲
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.63,1:15:02.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宇宙里最高級存在者
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.79,1:15:03.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們等著吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.96,1:15:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不久以后你們也會被寄身的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.50,1:15:11.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他說會被寄身的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.24,1:15:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是寄生生物吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.17,1:15:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄生生物?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.91,1:15:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己沒有身體只有腦部
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.68,1:15:21.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以寄生到其他動物身上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.15,1:15:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意操縱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.42,1:15:24.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像操縱木偶一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.92,1:15:27.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開什么玩笑 怎能被他們操縱
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.85,1:15:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是銀河系的危機呀
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.12,1:15:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當\N趕緊用任意門聯絡警衛隊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.03,1:15:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對呀，沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.56,1:15:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當，振作一點
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.17,1:15:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超空間被封鎖住了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.77,1:15:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那四次元口袋也不能用啰?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.54,1:15:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.81,1:15:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！你...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.11,1:15:54.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起，讓你睡一下了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.45,1:15:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警覺到的時候已經太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.75,1:16:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周圍都是寄生人及妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.72,1:16:02.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若不是遇到車長
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.96,1:16:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也會變成寄生人了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.32,1:16:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次似乎事態嚴重了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.56,1:16:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當，沒辦法逃出去嗎?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.56,1:16:12.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一個好方法
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.80,1:16:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不知道行不行得通
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.74,1:16:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,試試看
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.31,1:16:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里是巡邏員
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.74,1:16:26.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有大火災
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.51,1:16:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火災到處都有，不管它們
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.35,1:16:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正有人類的地方都要破壞掉
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.12,1:16:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但要看好，別讓他們逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.26,1:16:42.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.37,1:16:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加速前進
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.05,1:17:02.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了耶！車長
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.01,1:17:05.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為動用了所有的發煙筒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.62,1:17:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像火災一樣耶
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.92,1:17:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連妖怪都被騙了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.89,1:17:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.24,1:17:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃走了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.04,1:17:34.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,600多人跟列車全部都被跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.58,1:17:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的身體要如何解決呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.75,1:17:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,0008號
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.25,1:17:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果讓警衛隊知道\N征服新銀河計劃的話
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.35,1:17:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎么辦?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.22,1:17:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敬愛的天兵，請別擔心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.16,1:17:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車的燃料都放掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.36,1:17:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎樣了?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.07,1:17:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以跑不遠的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.60,1:18:01.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他們一定會降落在\N附近小行星群里的某處
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.71,1:18:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么，趕快去找\N一定要將那600人得到手
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.09,1:18:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小叮當
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.59,1:18:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房間是顛倒的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.13,1:18:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么時候變成這樣的?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.50,1:18:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全睡著了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.33,1:18:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我的責任
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.84,1:18:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒有燃料的關系
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.14,1:18:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整個列車掉到惑星里了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.41,1:18:37.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是車長的責任
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.71,1:18:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說掉到某個星球了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.51,1:18:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是這樣耶
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.75,1:18:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以對寄生蟲這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.95,1:18:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 等你恢復成原來的阿福時\N才能讓你出來
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.12,1:18:51.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.82,1:18:53.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都在這里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.89,1:18:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓收集來了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.79,1:18:59.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他客人都沒事 只是都睡著了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.46,1:19:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時不會醒來的樣子
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.90,1:19:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去外面看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.30,1:19:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！怎么變這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.67,1:19:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這太嚴重了 亂七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.21,1:19:13.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還好我們沒怎樣
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.58,1:19:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因為這些灰的關系
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.25,1:19:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這座山是灰燼嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.98,1:19:22.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對！將礦石挖走后\N就剩這些灰燼了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.65,1:19:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說 這里是“禁斷星球”?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.32,1:19:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.66,1:19:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車頭若沒摔壞的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.80,1:19:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法修嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.63,1:19:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太難了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.07,1:19:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那逃出來也沒用了呀
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.97,1:19:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣像這個星球一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.64,1:19:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,餓死在這里嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.71,1:19:46.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫時可不必擔心這些
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.48,1:19:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請跟我來
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.81,1:19:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有巖石的地方\N是這星球的城市
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.92,1:19:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在沒有人住在那里
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.22,1:20:00.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但倉庫里應該藏有\N食物及水等東西
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.13,1:20:01.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.66,1:20:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！趕緊去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.63,1:20:07.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那個，那個就是倉庫
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.20,1:20:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！好棒呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.00,1:20:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都有耶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.34,1:20:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好像是便利商店一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.74,1:20:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,熱騰騰的漢堡耶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.54,1:20:18.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,義大利面
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.74,1:20:21.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有各種甜點呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.81,1:20:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能有銅鑼燒吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.82,1:20:26.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.45,1:20:28.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盡量多吃一點
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.42,1:20:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.42,1:20:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.06,1:20:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車長
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.26,1:20:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.50,1:20:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辦公室里發現這個東西
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.96,1:20:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這應該是地底1000公尺\N的礦坑圖吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.97,1:20:44.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.70,1:20:51.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么這一個是運送\N礦石出去的礦坑內車站吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.11,1:20:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜對了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.81,1:20:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那車頭應該還留著吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.58,1:20:57.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還要再吃
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.92,1:21:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然有車頭
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.42,1:21:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是所有的出口都被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.52,1:21:06.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.26,1:21:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想有車頭的話\N就可以逃出去了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.39,1:21:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.76,1:21:12.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,礦坑里都塌陷了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.73,1:21:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進去的話就出不來的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.20,1:21:16.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.27,1:21:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不要進去
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.14,1:21:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了，知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.87,1:21:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來討論作戰計劃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.91,1:21:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里有車頭啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.68,1:21:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口雖被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.02,1:21:34.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有好多洞口
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.55,1:21:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以想辦法繞遠路出來的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.76,1:21:40.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要有地圖 就不可能迷路啦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.59,1:21:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始探險
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.59,1:21:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是技安，我是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.40,1:21:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！竟然把阿福給忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.07,1:21:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄生蟲肚子也會餓嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.21,1:21:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是人類的身體嘛...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.81,1:21:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶點東西給他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.98,1:22:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是有點不甘心
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.92,1:22:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,測到重力亂波了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.22,1:22:11.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是人類跟列車的訊號
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.79,1:22:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速追蹤
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.06,1:22:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心你們的腳步
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.13,1:22:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有關系?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.40,1:22:25.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.84,1:22:29.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！這是上次洗澡時發現的幽浮
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.37,1:22:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該只是個玩具吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.71,1:22:33.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會是玩具嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.35,1:22:35.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像和寄生蟲有關系呀
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.25,1:22:41.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿給巴姆看看
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.12,1:22:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，食物拿來了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.56,1:22:46.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打開門嚕 小心一點
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.13,1:22:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，怎么了?阿福...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.66,1:22:53.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.17,1:22:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我換身體可是輕而易舉的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.84,1:23:06.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轉過這里就是第3區了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.28,1:23:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該有車頭的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.05,1:23:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！不行 都被落石擋住了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.68,1:23:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這里不行的話 只好退到7區了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.22,1:23:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有坍塌
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.46,1:23:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關系，還有其他的路
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.80,1:23:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是技安...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.80,1:23:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用噴槍噴過后就掉下來了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.00,1:23:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噴槍?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.13,1:23:31.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對，放在浴室的噴槍
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.64,1:23:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦！有聲音
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.94,1:23:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.51,1:23:40.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是寄生蟲的原形呀
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.91,1:23:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是這個噴槍?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.45,1:23:45.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對！就是這個
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.12,1:23:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真空肥皂
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.92,1:23:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是全身被肥皂包圍起來了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.36,1:23:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以變硬了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.53,1:23:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴姆先生...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.00,1:23:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請過來一下
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.40,1:23:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.00,1:24:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.24,1:24:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.34,1:24:13.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，振作點
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.71,1:24:17.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?我攻擊巴姆?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.88,1:24:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你被寄生蟲寄生了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.12,1:24:22.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但也因此找出弱點了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.96,1:24:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福恢復了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.16,1:24:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.29,1:24:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都聽小叮當說了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.93,1:24:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對大家做了不該做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.26,1:24:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別放在心上，都是寄生蟲害的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.83,1:24:37.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣同伴們都到齊了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.27,1:24:38.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.60,1:24:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！技安呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.34,1:24:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是哪里啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.21,1:24:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我迷路 搞不清楚方向了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.51,1:24:54.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有聲音
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.72,1:25:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰來救我們的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.86,1:25:03.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是來救我的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.46,1:25:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太好了\N- 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.40,1:25:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞什么嘛！我們都迷了路
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.84,1:25:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真失望
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.97,1:25:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們從宇宙掉到這個洞里來了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.31,1:25:19.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我為了進來找車頭的 但迷路了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.81,1:25:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車頭?在那邊有一輛啊
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.15,1:25:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.98,1:25:27.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是車頭耶
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.42,1:25:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有車頭的話 就能逃出禁斷星球了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.09,1:25:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們有救了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.83,1:25:39.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是，沒有出口要怎樣搬出去呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.06,1:25:44.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！真的是\N不能和命運之神作戰呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.64,1:25:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少也要記得把食物帶進來的呀
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.81,1:25:50.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！這是什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.51,1:26:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安...你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.65,1:26:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車里都找遍了 但沒看到人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.35,1:26:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上也找過了 找不到
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.39,1:26:07.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里了呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.69,1:26:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現技安的腳印了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.60,1:26:14.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕，跑到礦坑里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.03,1:26:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真是的\N- 不行！不能進去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.00,1:26:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不能坐視不管呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.34,1:26:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 技安\N- 技安...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.61,1:26:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險！坍塌了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.79,1:26:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.49,1:26:42.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 技安\N- 技安
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.86,1:26:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行！只好放棄了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.93,1:26:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，好可憐呀
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.97,1:26:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很粗暴，但也很體貼啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.53,1:26:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再也見不到他了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.61,1:27:04.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍法 穿墻術
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.72,1:27:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.52,1:27:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.39,1:27:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有救了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.55,1:27:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.80,1:27:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水和食物都裝上了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.33,1:27:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有武器就更好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.80,1:27:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然沒有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.64,1:27:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是只要一天\N就可能到警衛隊的星球
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.41,1:27:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.42,1:27:43.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接收到強烈的重力波
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.86,1:27:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷達也有列車影子的反應
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.99,1:27:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人就在前面了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.19,1:27:52.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 全力轉舵\N- 收到！全力轉舵
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.66,1:27:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要全抓起來 讓你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.37,1:27:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你的表現了喔
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.24,1:28:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發現列車了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.24,1:28:03.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終究還是出現了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.04,1:28:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比想像中還要早嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.44,1:28:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然很不甘心
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.24,1:28:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這種速度馬上就會被追上的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.51,1:28:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們沒有武器
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.91,1:28:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以能逃多遠就逃多遠
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.45,1:28:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,進入星屑的密集區吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.25,1:28:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否則無法躲避那么大的宇宙船啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.52,1:28:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這意見不錯
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.29,1:28:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車駕駛由我負責
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.36,1:28:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻煩你了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.36,1:28:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人都聚集了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.19,1:28:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,減速，收帆
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.26,1:28:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用減速
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.93,1:28:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在進入密集區前讓它們無法航行
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.17,1:28:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,攻擊開始
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.01,1:28:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要攻擊列車
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.28,1:28:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們需要人類的身體
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.12,1:28:54.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,列車失控了\N即將降落到那個星球上
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.04,1:29:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人類都出來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.14,1:29:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的身體是很珍貴的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.18,1:29:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不會做壞的用途的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.85,1:29:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么這么安靜?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.72,1:29:23.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒有任何反應
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.70,1:29:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住！寄生蟲們
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.90,1:29:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在等我們嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.94,1:29:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看槍
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.08,1:29:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.62,1:29:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯達，有沒有關系?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.32,1:29:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦?這是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.16,1:29:58.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.82,1:30:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯達
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.56,1:30:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真爽快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.46,1:30:03.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.06,1:30:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,徹退
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.20,1:30:09.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個金黃色的是老大
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.43,1:30:11.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要被逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.64,1:30:14.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎能輸給人類
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.61,1:30:18.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到海賊船里了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.88,1:30:20.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲到海賊船里了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.98,1:30:26.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你們瞧瞧寄生天兵的威力
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.58,1:30:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄生到機器人體內了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.49,1:30:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄生蟲雖無法像生物般的活動
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.66,1:30:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是能操作電腦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.56,1:30:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起噴水
Dialogue: 0,1:30:44.57,1:30:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！不行呀
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.44,1:30:47.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肥皂液無法噴到它
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.91,1:30:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先找地方躲起來
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.28,1:30:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人類
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.21,1:30:56.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自認為逃得過嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.42,1:31:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有一個
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.46,1:31:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嚇到了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.29,1:31:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 寄生到你身上看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.36,1:31:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.16,1:31:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遺憾啊
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.26,1:31:43.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，好厲害呀
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.67,1:31:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是大雄厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.94,1:31:53.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是射擊神槍手耶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.27,1:31:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.24,1:31:57.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！寄生蟲被逃掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.56,1:32:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉增加各位的麻煩
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.36,1:32:23.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也謝謝幫我們解決問題
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.80,1:32:27.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些寄生蟲不可能再來侵犯了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.27,1:32:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了能早日重建這個樂園
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.84,1:32:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會加油的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.28,1:32:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請加油
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.18,1:32:38.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也會盡力協助的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.12,1:32:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝各位
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.32,1:32:43.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,車長，請將他們安全送回
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.96,1:32:45.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.03,1:32:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一路小心，再見
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.91,1:33:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.68,1:33:15.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖是大冒險 但是很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.15,1:33:19.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的人也恢復了原狀 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.79,1:33:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯達的爸爸\N也答應好要重建樂園
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.43,1:33:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.53,1:33:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有責任的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.10,1:33:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是你的責任
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.70,1:33:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是寄生蟲的責任
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.54,1:33:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊！是寄居蟹的錯
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.57,1:33:35.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，是寄生蟲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.64,1:33:36.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對喔
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.51,1:33:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾經取笑你們是古代人
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.51,1:33:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.48,1:33:44.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真該學學各位的勇氣
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.62,1:33:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 他們是從20世紀星球來的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.85,1:33:50.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我們的祖先唷
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.66,1:33:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是祖父的祖父的\N祖父的祖父...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.33,1:33:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這種祖父呀
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.00,1:34:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就要著陸在\N20世紀太陽系第3惑星
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.00,1:34:06.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.74,1:34:08.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還要再來喔
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.27,1:34:10.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那當然
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.61,1:34:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍后就到站的是 地球 地球
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.58,1:34:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要忘記您隨身的行李
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.39,1:34:24.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請保重
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.76,1:34:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在海邊拾到的這小貝殼\Nで拾った　小さなこの貝が
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.84,1:34:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什么會變成螺旋的形狀?\Nどうして渦く形になったのか
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.40,1:34:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教曉我的 是你呀\N教えてくれたのは　貴方でした
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.55,1:35:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在夜空中閃爍的銀河\Nそれは夜空の　闇に輝く銀河
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.89,1:35:15.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貝殼聽到那聲音\Nその波音が貝にはこえて
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.78,1:35:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被銀河迷住了 變成螺旋的形狀\N銀河に見とれて　渦いたという
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.57,1:35:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的耳朵\N私の耳も
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.30,1:35:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有貝殼\N貝の
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.62,1:35:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也想聽到你的聲音\N貴方の?がきたいけれど
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.65,1:35:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你卻比星星還要遙遠\N貴方は星より遠い人
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.65,1:36:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心中感到奇怪\N私の心の不思議さは
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.66,1:36:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當我靜靜想起你的時候\N貴方をかに思い出す時
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.10,1:36:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情就如銀河般 起伏不定\N銀河とおなじ　渦をく
